Package: apt-https-curl
Name: HTTPS for APT (curl)
Version: 1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Section: System
Priority: optional
Depends: curl, ca-certificates
Maintainer: tslmy
Author: tslmy
Description: HTTPS support for Cydia and apt on iOS 6, via curl
 Replaces apt's "https" download method with one that runs curl (OpenSSL).
 iOS 6's system TLS library has no AES-GCM, so repos on GCM-only servers fail
 with error -1200. The original method is kept as https.cfnetwork and comes
 back when this package is removed.
